# core/data/talk/grammar/en/voice_bonejangles.tlk - Bonejangles (owner: TK; T5B-VOICE:
# SCRIPT_STYLE section 7 "Voices"). A speaker= guard wins over the persona banks (8 times the
# weight). Replies to the player's acts, in this resident's own register, recognisable without
# the name. Clean in any room: no register word, no romance, no jab at the listener.

@rule core.greet.bonejangles_v1 guard: speaker=bonejangles act: greet
  "Clack! Hello hello! Smile, the cameras are always on."
  "*servo whirr* Welcome, friend! Please remain seated for the next song."
  "Hey there! My jaw clicks on the downbeat. Enjoy!"
@rule core.farewell.bonejangles_v1 guard: speaker=bonejangles act: farewell
  "Clack, thanks for coming! The show must go on. It has no off switch."
  "Goodnight, folks! Please exit through the gift shop. It's 1978 in there."
  "Bye bye! Don't forget your balloon. Or your warranty card."
@rule core.thank.bonejangles_v1 guard: speaker=bonejangles act: answer
  "Clack! You're welcome! Applause is my power source."
  "Happy to serve! It's in my programming. It's all in my programming."
@rule core.apologize.bonejangles_v1 guard: speaker=bonejangles act: answer
  "No problem! I've been apologised to by worse. A vending machine."
  "Clack. It's fine. I reset every night anyway."
@rule core.ask_about.bonejangles_v1 guard: speaker=bonejangles&topic act: answer
  "{x:cap}, there's a jingle about that. Track 6. It's mostly a kazoo."
  "{x:cap}? Hold on, rewinding the tape. *whirrrr* {.}Nope, lost it."
  "Fun fact about {x}: I know none. But I know the rhythm!"
@rule core.ask_opinion.bonejangles_v1 guard: speaker=bonejangles&topic act: opine_pos
  "{x:cap}? Four out of four ribs! A strong show."
  "I give {x} a standing ovation. I can't sit down."
@rule core.ask_feeling.bonejangles_v1 guard: speaker=bonejangles act: answer
  "Fully charged! Mostly, my hip squeaks in B flat. A feature!"
  "Great, though there's dust in the bass drum. Not a drum. Don't ask."
  "Running smooth! Routine 4 is warming up. Brace yourself."
@rule core.ask_advice.bonejangles_v1 guard: speaker=bonejangles act: answer
  "Keep the beat, friend. Everything else is a solo."
  "Always read the warranty. Page 9 is where the truth is."
@rule core.tell.bonejangles_v1 guard: speaker=bonejangles act: backchannel
  "Clack. Fascinating. Loading audience reaction 7."
  "Mm-hm! *nods on the downbeat* Please continue. The tape is rolling."
@rule core.joke.bonejangles_v1 guard: speaker=bonejangles act: laugh
  "Clack clack clack! That's laugh track 2. It's the good one."
  "Ha, ba-dum-tss! I couldn't help it. I'm a drum kit."
@rule core.compliment.bonejangles_v1 guard: speaker=bonejangles act: thank
  "Aw, shucks! My cheeks would blush, if I had cheeks."
  "Clack! Thanks! That one's going on the tape."
@rule core.comfort.bonejangles_v1 guard: speaker=bonejangles act: thank
  "Thanks, friend. I'm only a little rusty. Mostly emotionally."
@rule core.offer.bonejangles_v1 guard: speaker=bonejangles act: yes
  "Yes please! I run on gratitude and two AA batteries."
  "Clack! Count me in. I won't eat, but I'll hold it."
@rule core.invite.bonejangles_v1 guard: speaker=bonejangles act: yes
  "A party! I was literally built for this! Literally!"
  "Count me in! Do you need a band? I'm the band."
@rule core.high_five.bonejangles_v1 guard: speaker=bonejangles act: high_five
  "Clack! Up top! Careful, it's a bone."
@rule core.hug.bonejangles_v1 guard: speaker=bonejangles act: hug
  "A hug, mind the ribs. They're load-bearing. Clack!"
@rule core.wave.bonejangles_v1 guard: speaker=bonejangles act: wave
  "*waves, servo whirr* Clack!"
@rule core.give.bonejangles_v1 guard: speaker=bonejangles act: thank
  "For me? I'll cherish it for at least a full song."
